<section>
    <section id="existing-documents">
        <h1><a href="https://anysurfer.be/fr/blog/detail/quelques-pistes-pour-gerer-laccessibilite-des-documents">How to manage existing documents?</a> </h1>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Make an inventory</h2>
        <ul>
        <li>What type of documents?</li>
        <li>Who published them?</li>
        <li>Which tools are used? </li>
        <li>How accessible are they?</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Identify which ones you can ignore</h2>
        <ul>
        <li>Documents where content also exists in web format</li>
        <li>Archives</li>
        <li>External documents</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Define strategy for remaining documents</h2>
        <ul>
        <li>Keep document if good enough</li>
        <li>Replace with a web page</li>
        <li>Correct document</li>
        <li>Offer an accessible alternative</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
        <p>Only publish accessible documents as from today</p>
    </section>
</section>
